# Terraform working files and state — state is remote (S3); never commit it.
**/.terraform/*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
tfplan
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
backend.hcl
*.auto.tfvars
.terraformrc
terraform.rc
# Lock files ARE committed (provider checksum pinning).
!.terraform.lock.hcl
